<title>FRANCE: Sidel H1 net falls 47.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Sidel H1 net falls 47.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					     107.7 vs	   204.0</p>
<p>    Operating				     172.1 vs	   344.9</p>
<p>    Financial					 9.0 vs	    11.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				    1,413.4 vs	 2,028.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Sidel gave its results in a statement. It said second half net result should be higher than the first. Turnover for the full year should exceed three billion francs and 1997 should show growth, in view of favourable market conditions and a clearer medium term outlook for the group.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
